  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OHCHR. Addressing the human rights, migration and climate change nexus in the Sahel region. 2020-2021.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to address the human rights, migration and climate change nexus in the Sahel region. To do so the project will collect data and raise awareness and understanding on the nexus between climate change, human rights and migration, including through direct monitoring missions to communities and engagement with key stakeholders, and empowering  local communities, national  authorities, National Human Rights Institutions and civil society organizations, to adopt a human rights-based and gender-sensitive approach to migratory challenges associated with climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
